Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: M0LTE.S5066
Source: https://github.com/M0LTE/M0LTE.S5066
Comment:
 s5066-test ships as a self-contained single-file executable that bundles the
 .NET runtime and libraries (Copyright .NET Foundation and Contributors, MIT
 licence).
 .
 s5066-test links the M0LTE.S5066.Client library for its SIS client and, for
 its receive-only monitor's sound card capture, pdn-soundmodem through the
 M0LTE.S5066.Radio project. pdn-soundmodem is AGPL-3.0-or-later AND
 GPL-3.0-or-later AND GPL-3.0-only (its LICENSING.md lists the GPL-only files),
 so this binary is distributed under those terms combined, which AGPL section
 13 and GPL section 13 allow, and only under them. It is not available under
 the commercial licence that the libraries M0LTE.S5066.Core, M0LTE.S5066.Host
 and M0LTE.S5066.Client are also offered under.
 .
 Other bundled components: pdn-soundmodem's own dependencies (M0LTE.Dsp,
 M0LTE.Fec, M0LTE.Ms110d and others, AGPL-3.0-or-later; M0LTE.Il2p,
 GPL-3.0-or-later). Their licence texts are distributed with their upstream
 sources.

